# Read at build time and inlined into the static site: each environment has its own build.
# Origin of the API, which the browser calls directly (NEXT_PUBLIC_: it is public on purpose).
# It also goes into the CSP connect-src (src/lib/security-headers.ts).
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3001
# Public origin of the site, for the absolute URLs in metadata (Open Graph, sitemap, robots).
# In deploy the same env file feeds the API and the site, and it already carries WEB_ORIGIN
# for the links of the e-mails.
WEB_ORIGIN=https://localhost:3000
